# Build context for Dockerfile.tester-env.
#
# BuildKit reads this file INSTEAD OF the product root .dockerignore when it
# builds Dockerfile.tester-env, and only then. The product whitelist (a bare
# `*` plus a short allow-list) stays untouched for the product images it
# serves, but it cannot serve an editable-source build: it excludes the
# monorepo workspace sources and root manifests such as .npmrc.
#
# The build (pnpm fetch/install/build:deploy from the full monorepo checkout)
# keeps everything it reads: root manifests including .npmrc, patches/,
# scripts/, .github/scripts/, every workspace package source, and root
# configs. Only regeneration outputs, VCS metadata, secrets-shaped local env
# files, credential files, logs and editor noise are excluded. No negations:
# nothing needed is re-included from inside an excluded directory.
.git
.git/**
node_modules
node_modules/**
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
compiled
compiled/**
**/compiled
**/compiled/**
dist
dist/**
**/dist
**/dist/**
.turbo
.turbo/**
**/.turbo
**/.turbo/**
coverage
coverage/**
coverage-by-spec
coverage-by-spec/**
**/coverage
**/coverage/**
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/google-generated-credentials.json
*.log
**/*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.vscode
.vscode/**
**/.vscode
**/.vscode/**
.idea
.idea/**
**/.idea
**/.idea/**
*.swp
**/*.swp
